WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.340
In Jerusalem, a small group of very
religious Jews refuses to vote in Israel's

2
00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.510
elections.

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.160
They call themselves Neturei
Karta: guardians of the city.

4
00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:15.760
Other religious Jews see the very same
state as the beginning of redemption.

5
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.650
And most of the people who
founded it were secular.

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.040
So why do some very religious Jews
refuse to recognise a Jewish state?

7
00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.250
In this mission, you'll meet
the many kinds of Zionism:

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.570
political, cultural, Labour,
Revisionist and religious.

9
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.780
Then you'll read an ancient love poem
that rabbis have read in very different

10
00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.800
ways.

11
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:42.370
Your mission: find out why some very
religious Jews refuse to recognise the State.
